WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.486
Reviewer: One more feature to test: Describe this page.

2
00:00:03.486 --> 00:00:07.270
Reviewer: A screen reader reads a page one item at a time, in a line.

3
00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.670
Reviewer: It doesn't say that the essays fill most of the page,

4
00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.300
Reviewer: or that a narrow column sits beside them.

5
00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:16.943
Reviewer: For someone who's blind, a picture of the layout is a map.

6
00:00:16.943 --> 00:00:19.846
Reviewer: It says what's on the page before reading all of it,

7
00:00:19.846 --> 00:00:24.480
Reviewer: and where things are when a sighted colleague says it's in the column on the right.

8
00:00:25.159 --> 00:00:28.403
VoiceOver: system has new window

9
00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:31.255
VoiceOver: Describe this page dialog pop up button

10
00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:35.855
Tester: It's the second thing on the page, right after the skip link. I'll press it.

11
00:00:36.479 --> 00:00:41.719
VoiceOver: The home page web dialog with 9 items heading level 2 The home page

12
00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:46.428
Tester: It says the dialog's name, The home page, and its heading… and stops there.

13
00:00:46.428 --> 00:00:49.819
Tester: The picture of the page isn't read until I go looking.

14
00:00:50.444 --> 00:00:52.519
VoiceOver: Close button

15
00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:57.582
VoiceOver: This is the front page of a magazine. The newest essays take most of the page, and a narrower column beside them lists everything else.

16
00:00:57.582 --> 00:01:00.164
VoiceOver: heading level 3 From top to bottom

17
00:01:00.164 --> 00:01:02.208
VoiceOver: list 7 items

18
00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:03.898
VoiceOver: 1

19
00:01:03.898 --> 00:01:09.899
VoiceOver: At the top, the site header: my name, which goes home, then links to Writing, Work, Signal, Tools and Resume, then Set for you, where you choose the drawings, theme and motion. Beside it is a button that pauses everything that moves.

20
00:01:11.841 --> 00:01:15.364
Tester: It starts with a picture: the front page of a magazine,

21
00:01:15.364 --> 00:01:20.297
Tester: the newest essays taking most of the page, and a narrower column beside them.

22
00:01:20.297 --> 00:01:23.115
Tester: Then it walks the layout from top to bottom.

23
00:01:23.518 --> 00:01:24.892
Reviewer: What it says is useful.

24
00:01:24.892 --> 00:01:27.101
Reviewer: But on opening it only says its name,

25
00:01:27.101 --> 00:01:30.683
Reviewer: so someone has to explore to find out what the page is like.

26
00:01:30.683 --> 00:01:35.518
Reviewer: That's not a guideline failure, but it holds back the whole point of the feature.

27
00:01:36.205 --> 00:01:42.205
VoiceOver: At the top, the site header: my name, which goes home, then links to Writing, Work, Signal, Tools and Resume, then Set for you, where you choose the drawings, theme and motion. Beside it is a button that pauses everything that moves.

28
00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:47.740
Reviewer: The fix, now live: the heading carries the description,

29
00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.446
Reviewer: so it's read the moment the dialog opens.

30
00:01:50.446 --> 00:01:52.359
Reviewer: Same steps, on the live site.

31
00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:55.321
VoiceOver: link Skip to content

32
00:01:55.321 --> 00:01:58.199
VoiceOver: Describe this page dialog pop up button

33
00:01:58.199 --> 00:02:04.199
VoiceOver: The home page web dialog with 9 items heading level 2 The home page This is the front page of a magazine. The newest essays take most of the page, and a narrower column beside them lists everything else.

34
00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:11.500
Tester: This time it reads the picture straight away: the front page of a magazine,

35
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:14.192
Tester: the newest essays taking most of the page.

36
00:02:14.594 --> 00:02:17.724
Reviewer: Now the feature does its job from the first second.

37
00:02:17.724 --> 00:02:21.469
Reviewer: Whether the description helps is for blind people to tell us.

38
00:02:22.122 --> 00:02:26.070
VoiceOver: Describe this page dialog pop up button
